# The canonical origin this deployment serves from, with no trailing slash.
# Read at BUILD time (robots.txt and sitemap.xml are prerendered), so it must be
# set on the build environment, not just at runtime. Omit it and the site falls
# back to the production domain, https://www.unswilluminate.com.
SITE_URL=

# Set to "true" to keep a deployment out of search results entirely — noindex
# metadata, an X-Robots-Tag header on every response, and a robots.txt that
# disallows all crawling. Use it on any mirror served from a domain other than
# the canonical one, so only one origin ranks for this content. Also read at
# BUILD time. Anything other than "true" leaves the site indexable.
SITE_NOINDEX=
